PHASE 1 — RECON
═══════════════
tool:  nmap

The Crazy Ants run on 10.4.12.0/24. Hit it with nmap and find the
host you want — the back-office one that's accidentally reachable
from outside.

  nmap 10.4.12.0/24           full sweep, all 256 addresses
  nmap 10.4.12.88             zoom on one host
  nmap --help                 if you're lost

The output is long. Pipe it through less if you want to page it:

  nmap 10.4.12.0/24 | less    space = next page, q = quit

When you've got the address:

  apply m0use{HOST:PORT}

Stuck?  cat hint  — no penalty.
